    case MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (Leaf)))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))) -> 1
    case _ -> 0

deepVal : Box
let deepVal = MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (MkBox (Leaf))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))

hitDeep : Int
let hitDeep = probe deepVal
